{"title": "House in Deep Shadows", "pageid": 8493, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/House_in_Deep_Shadows", "categories": ["Locations", "Act Two Locations"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:House_in_Deep_Shadows.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/House_in_Deep_Shadows.jpg/300px-House_in_Deep_Shadows.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/House_in_Deep_Shadows.jpg/450px-House_in_Deep_Shadows.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/23/House_in_Deep_Shadows.jpg/600px-House_in_Deep_Shadows.jpg.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/House_in_Deep_Shadows.jpg/300px-House_in_Deep_Shadows.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/House_in_Deep_Shadows.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  Ruined Farmhouse that was Oliver's former home.  </div></figcaption></figure>The <b>House in Deep Shadows</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Location\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Location\">Location</a> within the <a href=\"/wiki/Ruined_Battlefield\" title=\"Ruined Battlefield\">Ruined Battlefield</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.  \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:House_in_Deep_Shadows_Location.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/House_in_Deep_Shadows_Location.png/300px-House_in_Deep_Shadows_Location.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/House_in_Deep_Shadows_Location.png/450px-House_in_Deep_Shadows_Location.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/House_in_Deep_Shadows_Location.png/600px-House_in_Deep_Shadows_Location.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/House_in_Deep_Shadows_Location.png/300px-House_in_Deep_Shadows_Location.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"210\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/House_in_Deep_Shadows_Location.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>In-game location.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The farmhouse is found south-east of <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a>, just up the road east of the Shadowed Battlefield waypoint. This location is also marked as the <b>House of Flowers</b> during the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lift_the_Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lift_the_Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\">Lift the Shadow Curse</a>, and is the area that <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/38px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/50px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halsin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\">Halsin</a> is referring to when he asks the party to seek \"a place where flowers still grow\".\n</p><p>Inside the house, an ill-fated <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">Githyanki</a> warrior can be spoken to via <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/38px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/50px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\">Speak with Dead</a>. Just to the south-west at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;19&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;17</span>, a dead <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Duergar\">Duergar</a> can found carrying the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grey_Scout%27s_Journal\" title=\"Grey Scout's Journal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grey_Scout%27s_Journal\" title=\"Grey Scout's Journal\">Grey Scout's Journal</a>. A buried chest (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Survival Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Survival\" title=\"Survival\">Survival</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>) containing minor loot can be found directly beside him. More directly south of the house at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;42&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;0</span> is another buried chest (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Survival Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Survival\" title=\"Survival\">Survival</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>) with minor random loot.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Regional_Waypoints\">Regional Waypoints</span></h2>\n<p>This location contains the following <a href=\"/wiki/Waypoint\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Waypoint\">Waypoint</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/20px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/30px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/40px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowed Battlefield\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/20px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Shadowed Battlefield&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;276&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;297</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lift_the_Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lift_the_Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\">Lift the Shadow Curse</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_characters\">Related characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oliver\" title=\"Oliver\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png/30px-Portrait_Oliver.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png/45px-Portrait_Oliver.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png/60px-Portrait_Oliver.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oliver\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png/30px-Portrait_Oliver.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oliver\" title=\"Oliver\">Oliver</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_creatures\">Related creatures</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daddy\" title=\"Daddy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png/30px-Portrait_Wraith.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png/45px-Portrait_Wraith.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png/60px-Portrait_Wraith.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daddy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png/30px-Portrait_Wraith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daddy\" title=\"Daddy\">Daddy</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Doggy\" title=\"Doggy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Doggy.png/30px-Portrait_Doggy.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Doggy.png/45px-Portrait_Doggy.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Doggy.png/60px-Portrait_Doggy.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Doggy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Doggy.png/30px-Portrait_Doggy.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Portrait_Doggy.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Doggy\" title=\"Doggy\">Doggy</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mummy_(wraith)\" title=\"Mummy (wraith)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png/30px-Portrait_Wraith.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png/45px-Portrait_Wraith.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png/60px-Portrait_Wraith.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mummy (wraith)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png/30px-Portrait_Wraith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mummy_(wraith)\" title=\"Mummy (wraith)\">Mummy (wraith)</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_loot\">Notable loot</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oliver%27s_Diary\" title=\"Oliver's Diary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Oliver%27s_Diary\" title=\"Oliver's Diary\">Oliver's Diary</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Mental_Inhibition\" title=\"Ring of Mental Inhibition\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Mental_Inhibition\" title=\"Ring of Mental Inhibition\">Ring of Mental Inhibition</a></span> - inside a locked wooden chest in Oliver's house <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;76&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;39</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Shadows\" title=\"Ring of Shadows\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Shadows\" title=\"Ring of Shadows\">Ring of Shadows</a></span> - looted or pick-pocketed from Oliver, or awarded after playing with him.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-